// Windows resources of the application executable.
//
// The tray icon came from the Qt resource bundle, but the FILE had no icon at all, so the
// desktop shortcut and Explorer showed a generic one (reported by Alexander, 06.10.2026:
// "на рабочем столе в ярлыке иконки нет").
//
// voiceTyper.ico was built from assets/voiceTyper.png by the pure-Python converter recorded
// in the project notes (zlib + unfilter + BMP-in-ICO, commit 3f22de9). It is deliberately
// NOT the historical .NET icon: Alexander forbade taking the icon from the repository
// history. tools/generate-icons.ps1 regenerates this file and assets/icon-256.png from the
// same master; run it deliberately, because it rewrites tracked binaries.
IDI_ICON1 ICON DISCARDABLE "voiceTyper.ico"
